{
  "dom_id": "step-4311",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Simplifying a Radical Expression That Is Not a Perfect Square With Domain Restrictions",
  "problem": "Simplify $\\sqrt{18y^3}$ given that $y \\geq 0.$",
  "worked_solution": "We first write $18y^3$ as the product $9y^2\\cdot 2y$ which contains a perfect square $(9y^2).$ Then, we separate the product into two separate radicals, one of which can be simplified:\n\n$$\n\\eqalign{\n\t\t\\sqrt{18y^3} &= \\\n\t\t\\sqrt{9y^2 \\cdot 2y} &= \\\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\\sqrt{9y^2} \\cdot \\sqrt{2y} &= \\\t\t\n\t\t\\sqrt{(3y)^2} \\cdot \\sqrt{2y} &= \\\t\t\n\t\t|3y| \\cdot \\sqrt{2y} &= \\\t\t\n\t\t|3| \\cdot |y| \\cdot \\sqrt{2y} &= \\\n\t\t3 \\cdot |y| \\cdot \\sqrt{2y}\n\t}\n$$\n\nSince $y \\geq 0,$ we have $|y|=y,$ and we can simplify further. Therefore, our final answer is\n\n$$\n\\eqalign{\n\t\t3 \\cdot |y| \\cdot \\sqrt{2y} &= \\\n\t\t3 \\cdot y \\cdot \\sqrt{2y} &= \\\n\t\t3y\\sqrt{2y}. &\n\t}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-4311\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"4311\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"1363\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-4311\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-8\">Simplifying a Radical Expression That Is Not a Perfect Square With Domain Restrictions</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"4311\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                        